      "name": "Seed the work plan",
      "summary": "The plan becomes beans, so a resumed session or a sibling agent can pick it up.",
      "description": "The plan becomes beans, so a resumed session or a sibling agent can pick it up. The run's own bean was claimed by the Process_BeanOpen call before this step, so this step only notes the seeded plan on it; the beans themselves are written with the agent's own `beans create`, which no engine op performs. From here on, beans/ is the shared answer to 'what is done, what is next' — for humans and agents alike.",
